\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2022/01/05/75276545/44bc0572fae82d0a603c718885ab8609_1540991368897418254.jpg?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,jpg\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2022/01/05/75276545/44bc0572fae82d0a603c718885ab8609_1540991368897418254.jpg?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,jpg\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「魔药研析」活动即将开启。蒙德的炼金术士蒂玛乌斯正在试制某种传说中的炼金药剂，帮助蒂玛乌斯完成这项研究，似乎能获取丰厚的报酬…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2022/01/05/75276545/33535ffd725500f8904dde7d1ee9d04e_1653935114939463974.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2022/01/05/75276545/33535ffd725500f8904dde7d1ee9d04e_1653935114939463974.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e此外，\u003c/span\u003e「海歌纪行」中也增加了对应的活动任务，完成后可领取纪行经验。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2022/01/05/75276545/d9b79440cf8926ae8b1be0eaadb594c0_821388222794868952.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data